# Vendored HandObject native extension. The macOS build (CPU, arm64, CPython 3.10)
# is committed and shipped as-is; re-include it past the *.so rule above. The
# Windows _C.pyd is NOT committed — it is compiled from model/csrc at bundle time
# (the upstream prebuilt .pyd was CUDA-only and fails to load on CPU-only machines).
!python/handobj/lib/model/_C.cpython-310-darwin.so
